OL,3,GNEWSASandie Peggie says union did not
OL,4,Atake her case seriously
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nurse has told an employment tribunal
OL,7,Fshe did not believe her union
OL,8,Frepresentative took her objections to
OL,9,Fsharing female changing rooms with a
OL,10,Ftransgender colleague as seriously as
OL,11,Fshe did.
OL,13,FSandie Peggie claims the Royal College
OL,14,Fof Nursing (RCN) failed to properly
OL,15,Fsupport and advise her after she was
OL,16,Fsuspended over a complaint about her
OL,17,Fbehaviour by Dr Beth Upton. The RCN
OL,18,Fdisputes the claim.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
