OL,3,GNEWSASandie Peggie says union did not
OL,4,Atake her case seriously
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the second employment tribunal
OL,7,FPeggie has brought over the dispute
OL,8,Fwith Upton ` a transgender woman who
OL,9,Fwas born biologically male.
OL,11,FPeggie partially won a claim for
OL,12,Fharassment against NHS Fife in December
OL,13,Flast year, but her other allegations of
OL,14,Fdiscrimination and victimisation were
OL,15,Fdismissed.
